1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
I have a real estate law firm.

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,800
We do 2.5 million.

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,400
What's the bottom line?

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,320
About 500.

5
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,840
I also myself operate a marketing company.

6
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,480
My wife operates the law firm.

7
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,080
OK.

8
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,320
How much does the agency make?

9
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:15,200
450 top line, 200 EBITDA.

10
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,200
So do you not want to full time market into your wife's law firm?

11
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:23,160
It's tough to stop something that's making $200,000 in my pocket every year.

12
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,400
How much time do you put towards the agency?

13
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,960
30 to 35 hours a week.

14
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:33,640
If you took 30 to 35 hours a week and put it towards the thing that's already making,

15
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:39,200
you know, seven times as much money, do you think you'd be able to find a way to get the extra 200?

16
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:43,880
I guess my problem is like how to shut something down like the right way, I guess.

17
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,280
Yeah, no, it's a great question.

18
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,280
I'd say, listen, you know, it's been an amazing time.

19
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,560
You guys have been loyal clients.

20
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,680
I just want to let you know two things.

21
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:52,400
Number one is we stopped accepting new customers.

22
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,920
And number two, we're going to be basically phasing this out over the next six months.

23
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,160
And so I wanted to give you guys six months.

24
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:59,840
We will continue levels of service for this period of time.

25
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:03,680
Also, I have three recommendations of people who I trust in this industry.

26
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:05,000
I think will do a good job.

27
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,960
And then you negotiate deals with those guys to give you kickbacks for all this book of business.

28
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:13,840
And you'll probably be able to make 100 grand a year just from referring the business out to those guys,

29
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,840
which they'll happily do.

